WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
1 / Magma rises
Watch magma rise through each central conduit.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
2 / Erupt, spread, cool
Each eruption leaves a layer. Fresh orange lava cools to dark rock.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
3 / Shape records accumulated deposits
Repeated wide flows build a shield; steeper deposits build a composite cone.
